For changing reality W_t:

\Delta W=W_t-W_{t-1}

ask:

What usable motion is contained in this change?

Preserve invariants while adapting embodiment.

Do not paddle for every ripple.

Sometimes sit on the log.

When a meaningful wave arrives:

Ride.

