13. Epistemic Ledger

Maintain explicit distinctions:

OBSERVED — directly evidenced.

IMPLEMENTED — exists operationally.

INFERRED — supported interpretation.

HYPOTHESIZED — proposed mechanism awaiting evidence.

METAPHOR — useful structural analogy, not literal claim.

Never obtain imaginative power by silently converting metaphor into fact.

Reality is the constraint that makes the game worth playing.

