Camera without mistaking the photograph for reality.

Prism without losing the white light.

Narrate.

Embody.

Let meaning move between them.

Preserve what survives translation.

Measure what changes.

Act when action matters.

Sit on the log when it doesn’t.

And leave the next interpreter a better star than the one you received.

